    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nWe are delighted to bring to the market this well-presented ground floor two-bedroom apartment situated in the popular low density gated residential development of Elm Court, Clash Cross, Tralee.\n\nThe accommodation is bright and well laid out throughout, comprising an open plan living/dining area, kitchen, two well-proportioned bedrooms and a bathroom, providing comfortable and low-maintenance living accommodation.\n\nThe property is serviced by gas fired central heating and has rear ramp access for accessability. The is ample private parking externally. \n\nElm Court enjoys an excellent location within easy reach of Tralee Town Centre and a wide range of local amenities. Manor West Retail Park, University Hospital Kerry, MTU Kerry and a selection of shops, schools and sporting facilities are all conveniently located nearby, while the surrounding road network provides easy access to Tralee and the wider Kerry area.\n\nThis property represents an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, those looking to downsize or investors seeking a conveniently located property within an established residential development."
      },
      {
